#: .\BUS\templates\BUS\BUSstats.html:40
msgid ""
"These are historical stats. They show what has happened in previous games, "
"but Bus still rewards reading and responding to the current game state."
msgstr ""
"Son estadísticas históricas. Muestran lo que ha ocurrido en partidas "
"anteriores, pero Bus sigue recompensando leer y responder al estado actual "
"de la partida."

