#: .\BUS\templates\BUS\BUSstats.html:45
#| msgid ""
#| "Every player starts with 20 action points, and each chosen action costs "
#| "one. 'Everyone else' is every losing player. Compare 'Win %% when used' "
#| "against a fair share of wins (100%% divided by the player count) to see "
#| "how the action is linked to winning."
msgid ""
"Every player starts with 20 action points, and each chosen action costs one. "
"'Everyone else' is every losing player. Compare 'Win &#37; when used' "
"against a fair share of wins (100&#37; divided by the player count) to see "
"how the action is linked to winning."
msgstr "Cada jugador empieza con 20 puntos de acción, y cada acción elegida cuesta uno. «Todos los demás» son los jugadores perdedores. Compara «Victorias &#37; al usarla» con una cuota justa de victorias (100&#37; dividido entre el número de jugadores) para ver cómo se relaciona la acción con ganar."

